    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the clockwork laboratory of the infamous inventor, Lord Percival. The room is filled with the hiss of steam, the scent of burning coal, and the ticking of countless brass gears. The heavy iron door has sealed shut behind you, trapping you in this subterranean workshop. Above the door sits the Main Brass Console, the only device capable of unlocking your exit. However, the console's intricate mechanisms have been decoupled. To escape, you must decipher the interconnected mechanical puzzles scattered throughout the lab, routing the correct pneumatic signals and aetheric energies through the inventor's bizarre devices to power up the final console.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
